      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KICKER ZOOM (8) has a terrific record this track and trip with two wins and one placing from three starts. Below best last time at Maitland (22.85) in a Grade 5, finishing a 5 length fourth. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. JILLIBY SCOTTY (5) has missed the placings at his last couple but was in the money three back when third (22.97) at this track in a Grade 5. Can improve sharply here. GARY INDIANA (6) has been in the placings at his last two runs, most recently when third (23.31) in a Grade 5 over 400m at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a tricky draw. Can turn it around this time. TIGER TAILS (1) drops in journey and warrants respect.",
